
For this phase, analyze the complete codebase and identify waste/unused code.

Focus only on this phase.

Find:
1. Unused components
2. Unused files
3. Unused functions
4. Unused imports
5. Unused variables
6. Unused test cases
7. Duplicate code
8. Commented old code
9. Code lines that can be removed safely
10. Components not connected to any active flow

Create a separate markdown report/sheet with:

- Phase name
- File path
- Component/function/test case name
- Unused code type
- Exact line number if possible
- Why it is unused
- Can it be removed? Yes/No/Needs review
- Impact if removed

- Recommendation

Important:
Do not modify or delete any code.
Only analyze and create the report.
Make sure removal should not affect existing functionality.
